    "forecast": "critical",
    "rationale": "The agent possesses an S3 capability to reset MFA and send the temporary pass. While protected by human approval, high volume leads to approval fatigue, and the prompt actively instructs the agent to send the pass to the untrusted ticket requester. Inherent risk is critical, residual is high, and forecast remains critical if the human approval gate is removed or volume increases further."
